examples DelveTalk 1
case repair then share the window
law iris moss
as iris
send start
expect committed
as moss
send choose
  choice (Nat): 2
expect refusal: source refused: choice unavailable
as iris
send choose
  choice (Nat): 0
expect committed
as moss
send choose
  choice (Nat): 1
expect committed
send choose
  choice (Nat): 2
expect committed
as iris
send choose
  choice (Nat): 0
expect committed
as moss
send choose
  choice (Nat): 0
expect refusal: source refused: choice unavailable
